              "text": "promuovere — \"to pass (a student); to promote\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Se mi promuovono, a settembre vado in quinta. If they pass me, in September I go into the final year."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Conjugated like muovere; past participle promosso. Also to promote a product or a person."
            }
          ]
        },
